{"body":{"from":[{"$ref":"1M6ZRC9R3G3Z069"},{"$ref":"1M6ZRC9R3G3Z173"}],"opens":"What the engine should give is the bare language that effective queries against the field need, fast and native, with pure functions built upon it; today it gives 14 operations on sets of holons, with no numbers, map or fold, so Count and Measure cannot be written. Finding the few true primitives may turn several natives into ordinary functions in the field. It takes up Pure functions over a small kernel.","restsOn":["What queries the field actually needs to answer.","Which values a query holds beyond holons.","Which of the 14 natives remain native, by what speed asks."],"stands":"noted"},"id":"1M6ZRC9R3G3Z17Y","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000007"],"name":"The core language of a query"}
{"body":{"from":[{"$ref":"1M6ZRC9R3G3Z069"},{"$ref":"1M6ZRC9R3G3Z173"}],"opens":"The modules are already apparent, so each could ship a store of its own: the engine with the types it submits, a library of components with its components, the interface beside them. The session answered that the engine cannot be a store, for its code must start first; the author meant the engine's types, which can. store/glass, made from src/field, would divide along these lines, and src/field is a strange name for what it holds.","restsOn":["A store's components run only from glass and the home until they can run apart.","What belongs to the engine's store, and what a store needs from another.","What the web does differently from a local field."],"stands":"noted"},"id":"1M6ZRC9R3G3Z17Z","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000007"],"name":"A module ships its store"}
{"body":{"from":[{"$ref":"1M6ZRC9R3G3Z173"}],"opens":"The engine works on the web and locally, so agents could read a local field through it too. Today the tools read the store directly and the browser alone reads through the engine, so there are two ways of reading.","restsOn":["The author wished to discuss this further in the next session.","What an agent would call, and what the probe and read tools become."],"stands":"noted"},"id":"1M6ZRC9R3G3Z180","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000007"],"name":"Agents through the engine, locally"}